   "sec": 19.92,
   "heard": "UPSC, twenty-twenty-six. General Studies Paper Two, ten marks, a hundred and fifty words. Privacy and self-identity sit under Article twenty-one. Examine what the twenty-twenty-six amendment did to the Transgender Persons Act. Here is the catch. The Act once gave a right to self-perceived identity. Did it survive?"
  },
